<title>UK: Dresdner Finance prices 1.5 bln mark warrant bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Finance prices 1.5 bln mark warrant bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresdner Finance BV has priced its 1.5 billion mark bond with warrants in the form of a rights issue, lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson said.</p>
<p>The seven-year deal is guaranteed by Dresdner Bank AG.</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    30.APR.04</p>
<p> TYPE   STR/WW	  ISS PRICE  115 PCT   FULL FEES   2.50</p>
<p> LISTING    =	   DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.0	 SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  1/3</p>
<p> NOTES	EXERCISABLE INTO SHARES OF DRESDNER BANK AT A</p>
<p>DISCOUNT</p>
<p>OF 8 PCT TO REFERENCE PRICE (ONE WARRANT PER SHARE). RIGHTS PERIOD</p>
<p>TO 24.APR. EXERCISE PRICE IS 51.30 DEM. THERE ARE 19 WARRANTS PER BOND -- LONDON NEWSROOM +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
